and was volunteering at the Houston Food Bank

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.190
for Ted Cruz's constituents.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:23.430
Now, Ted Cruz, thank AOC.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.800
No, he didn't.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:26.800
Did Texas Gov..

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.710
