00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:40.430
Thank AOC and other Democrats who flew to
Texas and went to work at the Houston Food

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:46.230
Bank to help Ted Cruz's constituents know
they didn't thank them for that either, either.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:52.570
And when Ted Cruz finally mentioned AOC, it
was Friday during his CPAC speech.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.179
We saw this clip earlier during our Ted Cruz
clip.

00:00:55.179 --> 00:00:56.179
