experience during the January 6th Trump riots.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.570
Bernie.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:10.020
Is wearing mittens.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.890
And AOC is telling us she was murdered.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:28.719
And the media desperately, desperately, desperately
wants to see a Republican civil war.

00:01:28.719 --> 00:01:35.130
Now, what is Ted Cruz even talking about,
aside from just being a disgusting human being?

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:41.369
Ted Cruz is referring to the Twitter exchange
in which AOC had tweeted that, quote, There

00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:47.439
must or not not quote, which she tweeted that
there must be an investigation of Robin Hood

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:50.760
for their role in the GameStop fiasco.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:55.390
