00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:13.430
But you almost had me murdered three weeks
ago.

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:15.640
So you can sit this one out.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.720
Happy to work with almost any other Republicans
that aren't trying to get me killed.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:24.000
In the meantime, if you want to help, you
can resign.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.020
Now, some people loved this response from
